WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.133 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 4=

01:38.149 --> 01:39.429
Once you've finished this bowl,

01:39.670 --> 01:41.190
we'll put you in the bridal sedan.

01:41.630 --> 01:42.789
Then Zuo Junjie

01:43.069 --> 01:44.869
won't get anything out of you either.

01:45.030 --> 01:46.349
He can be a widower instead.

01:46.789 --> 01:47.642
The family

01:47.830 --> 01:49.509
will make offerings at your grave.

01:49.949 --> 01:50.910
Let go!

01:50.990 --> 01:51.869
Yuwei!

01:53.730 --> 01:54.310
I...

01:54.630 --> 01:55.789
I won't drink it!

01:56.830 --> 01:58.990
Old Madam really does know you best.

01:59.470 --> 02:01.589
The two of us
have never served you before.

02:02.270 --> 02:03.509
Perhaps we're not close enough.

02:04.429 --> 02:05.630
Bring in someone else,

02:05.630 --> 02:07.069
and maybe you'll drink it.

02:17.510 --> 02:18.629
My Lady.

02:24.270 --> 02:25.110
Yuwei.

02:25.469 --> 02:26.469
They told me,

02:27.350 --> 02:29.550
if I fail to get this done,

02:31.149 --> 02:33.510
everyone in my household will die.

02:35.990 --> 02:36.519
I...

02:36.519 --> 02:38.189
I had no choice.

02:45.429 --> 02:45.990
No!

02:46.270 --> 02:46.950
No!

02:47.429 --> 02:48.110
No!

02:48.189 --> 02:49.189
No!

02:49.629 --> 02:51.189
Don't do this, Yuwei!

02:51.550 --> 02:52.469
Let me go!

02:53.110 --> 02:54.510
Yuwei!

02:54.869 --> 02:56.149
Let me go!

02:57.909 --> 02:59.149
Yuwei!

03:01.230 --> 03:02.189
Yuwei!

03:03.709 --> 03:04.670
My Lady.

03:06.270 --> 03:07.230
Do not be afraid.

03:08.083 --> 03:08.513
I...

03:08.556 --> 03:09.469
I'll face death

03:09.830 --> 03:10.990
by your side.

03:13.469 --> 03:14.629
Do not fear.

03:17.429 --> 03:18.429
Yuwei.

03:29.709 --> 03:31.070
(We are)

03:31.070 --> 03:33.950
(a family of standing.)

03:34.429 --> 03:36.990
(And with those three arches
at our gate,)

03:37.270 --> 03:39.629
(I will make certain you marry
above your station.)

03:40.510 --> 03:42.550
(Would the girl I raised)

03:42.550 --> 03:44.670
(end up wasted within these walls?)

03:46.629 --> 03:47.629
My Lady.

03:50.029 --> 03:51.149
My Lady.

03:51.909 --> 03:53.350
My Lady.

03:56.070 --> 03:58.029
I had no other choice.

04:09.189 --> 04:10.909
My Lady.

04:11.790 --> 04:12.670
Yuwei.

04:15.909 --> 04:16.550
Yuwei.

04:17.470 --> 04:18.150
Yuwei.

04:20.470 --> 04:21.309
Yuwei.

04:24.990 --> 04:26.389
Why?

04:28.670 --> 04:29.829
Yuwei.

05:14.990 --> 05:15.910
Yuwei.

05:41.437 --> 05:44.723
(Biyun Nunnery)

06:21.710 --> 06:22.543
What happened to you?

06:31.790 --> 06:33.150
I was drugged.

06:34.470 --> 06:35.550
Save me please.

06:37.030 --> 06:38.590
I don't want to die.

07:00.629 --> 07:01.429
Whatever.

07:01.910 --> 07:02.710
Spit it out.

07:03.629 --> 07:04.389
Spit it out!

07:17.710 --> 07:18.550
Listen closely.

07:19.350 --> 07:20.670
Only you can save yourself.

07:21.590 --> 07:22.629
I cannot help you.

07:24.389 --> 07:25.509
If you wish to live,

07:26.030 --> 07:27.230
spit out that potion.

07:27.949 --> 07:29.509
If you waste all your strength weeping,

07:29.910 --> 07:31.150
no one can come to your aid.

07:33.350 --> 07:34.269
Stop crying!

07:34.710 --> 07:35.590
Spit it out!

07:36.990 --> 07:38.829
I can't.

07:51.790 --> 07:52.749
What are you doing?

08:11.920 --> 08:14.826
♪The faint incense fades from boughs♪

08:15.693 --> 08:18.173
♪Lone wild geese know not
late autumn's woes♪

08:19.246 --> 08:22.739
♪If heaven's will, none can implore♪

08:23.186 --> 08:26.159
♪Mortal world's all absurd lore♪

08:26.202 --> 08:28.987
♪Dying candle burns all light away♪

08:29.030 --> 08:30.790
(I've studied poetry and classics
since childhood,)

08:30.990 --> 08:31.749
(learned to manage the household,)

08:32.190 --> 08:33.190
(and mastered
etiquette and social conduct)

08:33.909 --> 08:34.830
(I never wished to be)

08:34.830 --> 08:36.389
(a puppet manipulated by others.)

08:37.789 --> 08:39.029
(What I long to be)

08:39.549 --> 08:41.470
(is someone who masters her own fate.)

08:41.529 --> 08:45.115
♪Fate writes its tale,
never asking who I am today♪

08:45.529 --> 08:49.349
♪Spend all my remaining years,
yet no right can I claim♪

08:49.622 --> 08:51.741
♪All is ash upon the altar,
bearing guilt's shame♪

08:51.784 --> 08:56.902
♪Atone for my sin♪

09:01.552 --> 09:04.699
♪Shattered into dust thin♪

09:08.690 --> 09:14.853
♪When wind stirs, all drifts away,
no path back to win♪

09:15.693 --> 09:21.626
♪Blossoms sink and sway,
whose dreams linger to stay?♪

09:23.306 --> 09:27.813
♪Endless night stretches wide,
no need for tears to cry♪

09:42.669 --> 09:43.869
Spare my life, Old Madam!

09:43.869 --> 09:44.669
Old Madam!

09:44.669 --> 09:45.470
Where is she?

09:45.629 --> 09:47.070
We forced the potion down her throat.

09:47.230 --> 09:48.629
We went out

09:48.710 --> 09:49.869
to ask others to help carry her.

09:50.070 --> 09:52.549
When we came back,
she was already nowhere to be found.

09:52.549 --> 09:52.990
Mind

09:53.509 --> 09:55.190
your words before you speak.

09:55.389 --> 09:55.855
I understand.

09:55.898 --> 09:57.869
The Ninth Young Lady had terrible luck.

09:58.389 --> 09:59.269
She fell ill

09:59.430 --> 10:01.029
and died.

10:01.190 --> 10:01.830
Old Madam.

10:01.950 --> 10:03.710
The Ninth Young Lady died of illness.

10:03.710 --> 10:04.909
Since she has passed from illness,

10:05.029 --> 10:06.470
seal her coffin at once.

10:06.789 --> 10:08.950
Let her rest in peace.

10:09.350 --> 10:09.950
Understood.

10:26.749 --> 10:28.470
(Tingyun!)

10:29.830 --> 10:32.749
(Tingyun!)

10:36.549 --> 10:37.190
Miss Fan,

10:37.789 --> 10:39.230
this is a gift from Mr. Yu.

10:39.749 --> 10:40.310
Look

10:40.310 --> 10:41.269
how considerate he is.

10:41.549 --> 10:43.990
Who would've thought this marriage
would come to pass?

10:44.470 --> 10:45.110
Miss Fan,

10:45.269 --> 10:46.749
you are truly blessed with great luck.

10:49.950 --> 10:50.549
Miss Fan!

10:50.749 --> 10:51.310
Miss Fan!

10:51.830 --> 10:53.310
Why are you in such a fluster?

10:54.070 --> 10:54.669
Miss Fan.

10:55.149 --> 10:56.310
The Ninth Young Lady of the Fu family

10:56.749 --> 10:57.509
has died of illness.

10:58.629 --> 11:00.190
Master has a message for you.

11:00.549 --> 11:02.710
He says you should prepare
condolence gifts in advance,

11:02.990 --> 11:03.869
and funeral money.

11:04.230 --> 11:05.070
She's dead?

11:09.470 --> 11:10.710
Dead...

11:12.230 --> 11:13.629
How could she be dead?

11:15.470 --> 11:16.269
Tingyun...

11:17.830 --> 11:19.350
When Tingyun left for Biyun Nunnery,

11:19.350 --> 11:20.470
she was perfectly well, was she not?

11:22.029 --> 11:23.269
Everyone thinks

11:24.629 --> 11:26.070
she went there to recuperate.

11:28.190 --> 11:29.710
But we know the truth.

11:29.830 --> 11:31.590
She fled there to avoid misfortune!

11:32.070 --> 11:33.029
Do not fear, Miss Fan.

11:33.549 --> 11:34.830
Even if she died an unnatural death,

11:35.070 --> 11:35.669
it was...

11:35.830 --> 11:37.190
it was the Fu family that harmed her.

11:38.269 --> 11:39.350
The Fu family...

11:39.590 --> 11:40.110
Right.

11:40.830 --> 11:41.549
If anyone's to blame...

11:41.549 --> 11:42.310
The Fu family...

11:42.389 --> 11:44.629
It's the Ninth Young Lady's lofty pride.

11:44.789 --> 11:45.990
If she'd married Zuo Junjie,

11:45.990 --> 11:46.909
none of this would have come to pass.

11:47.190 --> 11:47.869
Surely.

11:48.110 --> 11:49.590
She'd rather have died
than consent to the marriage.

11:50.310 --> 11:51.830
Other ladies marry
beneath their station.

11:51.950 --> 11:53.110
Why could she not?

11:54.470 --> 11:55.149
Right.

11:57.149 --> 11:57.710
Exactly.

11:58.470 --> 11:59.789
Others could accept such a match.

12:01.629 --> 12:02.909
Why couldn't she?

12:03.950 --> 12:05.029
Why could others accept it,

12:05.029 --> 12:06.149
but not her?

12:06.549 --> 12:07.710
It's all her own doing.

12:08.190 --> 12:08.749
All...

12:08.749 --> 12:10.029
All her own fault!

12:12.476 --> 12:13.796
(Madam Zuo, respectfully)

12:13.839 --> 12:16.409
(Letter to the Fu Family
Regarding the Late Fu Tingyun)

12:21.959 --> 12:23.907
(Letter to the Fu Family
Regarding the Late Fu Tingyun)

12:23.950 --> 12:24.549
The...

12:26.549 --> 12:27.909
The body identification record.

12:28.710 --> 12:30.549
This is the woman you wanted
as your sister-in-law.

12:31.430 --> 12:32.710
The Old Madam has shown mercy.

12:33.029 --> 12:34.269
She lets you leave the Fu family,

12:34.269 --> 12:35.350
return to Ganlin Town at once,

12:36.110 --> 12:38.310
and tend to your chastity memorial arch.

12:39.509 --> 12:42.110
She could even bring herself
to harm her own granddaughter.

12:49.230 --> 12:50.190
Once, there was

12:51.110 --> 12:53.549
only a Zuo who married
into the Fu family.

12:54.149 --> 12:55.149
Now, there is

12:56.190 --> 12:59.110
also a Fu who married
into the Zuo family.

13:11.629 --> 13:12.470
Mr. Zhao, you are so wise.

13:12.669 --> 13:14.310
We can sell that woman for money.

13:14.509 --> 13:15.110
In my opinion,

13:15.749 --> 13:16.710
she's worth ten thousand taels.

13:17.909 --> 13:18.909
If that falls through,

13:19.190 --> 13:20.549
we can sell her by weight.

13:20.830 --> 13:22.350
Find a local slave broker,

13:22.470 --> 13:23.350
and sell her right here.

13:23.789 --> 13:25.350
We'll at least recoup some of our costs.

13:32.070 --> 13:32.749
Mr. Zhao,

13:32.950 --> 13:33.710
what shall we do

13:34.190 --> 13:35.350
with this woman in the end?

13:36.389 --> 13:37.909
The simplest option would be

13:38.869 --> 13:39.950
to pawn her off to the Fu family.

13:40.549 --> 13:41.590
Yet I think

13:42.590 --> 13:44.190
the Fu family is not worthy
of striking a deal with us.

13:44.430 --> 13:45.869
We hold the Fu family in contempt too.

13:46.509 --> 13:48.190
The hypocrites dwelling in noble manors

13:48.190 --> 13:49.430
are far less upright
than us unashamed knaves,

13:49.430 --> 13:50.149
who lay bare our greed plainly.

13:50.269 --> 13:51.190
Exactly.

13:51.350 --> 13:52.509
Yet we have no choice.

13:52.909 --> 13:54.990
A hundred thousand catties
of Ground Snow is being withheld.

13:55.430 --> 13:56.669
This trip to Huaying

13:56.669 --> 13:57.990
has left us with total losses.

13:58.389 --> 13:59.629
We failed to gain any profit,

13:59.749 --> 14:01.029
yet landed ourselves in a terrible mess.

14:12.909 --> 14:13.590
You're awake.

14:14.669 --> 14:15.509
Have some food.

14:32.389 --> 14:33.789
The doctor said you vomited in time.

14:36.749 --> 14:37.869
A couple of days' rest
will set you right.

14:45.830 --> 14:46.950
Last time I saw you,

14:47.669 --> 14:49.590
you had quite a sharp tongue.

14:51.749 --> 14:53.190
You're far quieter
and milder than usual today.

14:57.669 --> 14:58.710
Mr. Zhao,

14:58.710 --> 15:00.990
could you go see my mother for me?

15:01.749 --> 15:03.470
I wish to send word that I am safe.

15:04.629 --> 15:05.830
Tell me.

15:08.590 --> 15:10.749
What terrible mess you've gotten into

15:12.669 --> 15:14.029
that the Fu family would abandon

15:14.029 --> 15:15.149
someone as valuable as you?

15:20.789 --> 15:21.629
If you refuse to speak,

15:23.389 --> 15:25.230
there is no reason for me to aid you.

15:27.269 --> 15:28.869
They framed me falsely.

15:29.830 --> 15:31.110
I never committed adultery.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.029
I didn't.

15:38.749 --> 15:39.430
Adultery?

15:40.470 --> 15:42.149
A young lady of the Fu family
accused of adultery?

15:42.149 --> 15:43.830
How come I've never heard
of such a matter?

15:43.830 --> 15:44.710
I was wrongly accused.

15:44.710 --> 15:45.629
Biao, did you know?

15:45.629 --> 15:46.590
I had no idea.

15:46.636 --> 15:47.222
Hush.

15:56.629 --> 15:57.230
I believe you.

16:13.470 --> 16:14.310
All of you, step outside.

16:16.269 --> 16:17.110
Let's go.

16:33.789 --> 16:35.230
Even I find this hard to believe,

16:35.710 --> 16:37.070
so how could your own family believe it?

16:39.549 --> 16:40.710
They don't believe it either.

16:44.470 --> 16:47.149
But for the sake
of the arches at the gate,

16:52.029 --> 16:53.110
they cannot protect me.

16:55.789 --> 16:56.950
All under heaven bustle,

16:58.389 --> 16:59.470
chasing profit.

17:00.669 --> 17:01.789
This is human nature.

17:03.269 --> 17:04.150
Now you hold no use

17:04.150 --> 17:05.470
for them any longer.

17:06.910 --> 17:08.069
You've become their castaway.

17:30.269 --> 17:31.470
I do have a plan.

17:32.749 --> 17:34.549
It will let you avenge your wrongs,

17:35.349 --> 17:36.670
and send word to your mother

17:37.509 --> 17:38.269
that you still live.

17:45.269 --> 17:46.829
Would you dare step
into a bridal sedan chair?

17:53.910 --> 17:55.230
Well, I am

17:56.549 --> 17:57.749
holding a wedding

18:00.710 --> 18:01.589
tomorrow.

18:02.230 --> 18:03.509
A wedding?

18:05.029 --> 18:06.349
It's all just a show for others.

18:06.670 --> 18:07.829
Tomorrow's wedding ceremony

18:08.269 --> 18:09.190
must be grand

18:09.630 --> 18:10.430
and lavish.

18:10.950 --> 18:11.990
A luxurious bridal sedan,

18:12.150 --> 18:13.230
with the accompaniment
of gongs and drums.

18:14.269 --> 18:15.829
In short, its splendor

18:16.710 --> 18:18.630
shall outshine
the Fu family's funeral rites.

18:20.230 --> 18:21.910
I intend to make those of the Fu family

18:23.190 --> 18:25.109
pay a steep price.

18:30.710 --> 18:32.910
May your spirit roam beyond.

18:33.150 --> 18:35.710
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

18:36.430 --> 18:38.549
May your spirit roam beyond.

18:38.870 --> 18:41.296
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

18:41.339 --> 18:42.133
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Fu
of the Zuo Family)

18:42.176 --> 18:44.390
May your spirit roam beyond.

18:44.829 --> 18:47.470
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

18:49.670 --> 18:51.950
May your spirit roam beyond.

18:52.269 --> 18:54.990
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

18:55.789 --> 18:58.109
May your spirit roam beyond.

19:03.290 --> 19:08.350
(Double Happiness)

19:15.941 --> 19:18.815
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Fu
of the Zuo Family)

19:28.869 --> 19:30.349
(Grace Lost, Virtue Enduring)

19:58.749 --> 19:59.630
Old Madam.

19:59.630 --> 20:01.150
A wedding procession ahead

20:01.150 --> 20:02.269
is blocking the road.

20:02.789 --> 20:05.630
A wedding always gives way to a funeral.

20:05.672 --> 20:06.547
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Fu
of the Zuo Family)

20:06.589 --> 20:07.829
Tell them to move aside

20:08.390 --> 20:09.509
and let us go first.

20:15.060 --> 20:16.760
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Lady Fu
of the Zuo Family)

20:21.549 --> 20:22.390
Old Madam!

20:22.829 --> 20:23.630
Old Madam!

20:28.589 --> 20:30.069
My respects, Madam.

20:30.670 --> 20:32.109
I trust you have been well.

20:37.230 --> 20:38.269
What a fortunate coincidence.

20:39.309 --> 20:41.630
My bride happens
to be an old acquaintance of yours.

20:44.910 --> 20:46.509
Why not come and see her?

20:50.069 --> 20:51.670
Indeed, I should.

21:15.789 --> 21:16.749
Tingyun.

21:35.069 --> 21:36.269
Mr. Zhao,

21:37.630 --> 21:39.589
you address me as your elder,

21:39.789 --> 21:40.630
and today,

21:40.710 --> 21:42.430
you've wed a lovely lady.

21:43.190 --> 21:45.710
I ought to present a wedding gift.

21:47.470 --> 21:49.069
What would you like?

21:52.470 --> 21:54.870
Ten thousand taels of silver
is no small sum to gather,

21:55.829 --> 21:57.710
so grant me a few days' grace.

21:58.029 --> 21:59.549
I am blessed with abundant wealth.

22:00.870 --> 22:01.829
On this occasion,

22:04.870 --> 22:05.829
I seek no monetary gain.

22:13.870 --> 22:15.309
What do you want?

22:18.029 --> 22:19.150
I demand the Fu family

22:19.509 --> 22:21.549
return the one hundred thousand catties
of Ground Snow

22:23.269 --> 22:24.910
to its rightful owner.

22:25.710 --> 22:27.230
That contraband was seized long ago.

22:27.829 --> 22:29.789
The county yamen
has taken it into custody.

22:31.870 --> 22:33.829
The matter has been reported
to the imperial court.

22:34.269 --> 22:36.230
The county yamen is practically run
by your family.

22:36.670 --> 22:38.349
It would take but one word from you

22:38.950 --> 22:40.309
to release one hundred thousand catties
of Ground Snow.

22:42.470 --> 22:44.309
If you refuse me,

22:44.990 --> 22:46.230
my bride

22:46.349 --> 22:47.670
will not stay seated any longer.

22:48.390 --> 22:50.109
She will step out of the sedan chair.

22:51.349 --> 22:53.390
Then every soul in Huaying will learn

22:53.549 --> 22:54.870
that you have a granddaughter

22:55.549 --> 22:58.069
who came back from the dead
on her funeral day,

22:59.630 --> 23:01.269
and even married a man like me.

23:13.029 --> 23:14.749
Surrender her to me,

23:16.390 --> 23:17.470
and I will add

23:17.470 --> 23:18.630
ten thousand taels of gold,

23:18.950 --> 23:20.029
guaranteeing

23:20.390 --> 23:22.910
your safe departure from Huaying.

23:24.390 --> 23:26.150
Old Madam, you may misunderstand.

23:26.589 --> 23:28.150
It is not that you lack funds.

23:33.589 --> 23:35.309
It is your fortune itself

23:37.789 --> 23:39.470
that is tainted through and through.

23:43.509 --> 23:44.150
In this world,

23:44.150 --> 23:46.269
there are far too many folk like you,

23:46.710 --> 23:48.549
which leaves common folk
unable to afford salt.

23:49.950 --> 23:51.230
I would sooner scatter all the salt

23:51.230 --> 23:52.670
across the streets,

23:53.230 --> 23:54.749
than hand it over to you.

23:56.470 --> 23:57.430
I refuse to let it become

23:57.430 --> 23:59.789
another merit
to fuel your meteoric rise in status.

24:12.630 --> 24:13.670
Tingyun,

24:15.950 --> 24:17.789
are you going to turn your back
on your grandmother?

24:18.950 --> 24:20.950
I raised you for eighteen years.

24:21.269 --> 24:22.630
Just this once,

24:23.029 --> 24:24.549
I have wronged you.

24:24.950 --> 24:26.509
For the sake of our family,

24:27.470 --> 24:28.789
I failed to let you

24:29.190 --> 24:30.789
become a phoenix

24:31.950 --> 24:32.829
and find

24:33.069 --> 24:34.390
a worthy branch to rest upon.

24:38.190 --> 24:38.910
Grandmother,

24:41.710 --> 24:43.150
am I truly a phoenix?

24:45.390 --> 24:46.349
Or am I merely

24:50.870 --> 24:52.670
the branch meant only

24:53.230 --> 24:54.670
to lure phoenixes for you?

24:56.749 --> 24:57.910
You love me,

24:59.430 --> 25:01.789
yet you cherish the benefits
I bring you far more.

25:02.349 --> 25:03.710
You love this family too,

25:04.870 --> 25:06.430
yet you care far more for the power

25:06.430 --> 25:07.950
this family brings you.

25:19.190 --> 25:22.230
This is the girl raised by myself.

25:40.269 --> 25:41.749
Even if I hand over the salt now,

25:42.349 --> 25:44.069
will you ever get out of Huaying?

25:44.789 --> 25:46.069
And even if you do escape,

25:46.269 --> 25:48.870
where will you go?

25:54.509 --> 25:55.470
You need not

25:59.150 --> 26:01.470
trouble yourself over this, Old Madam.

26:13.470 --> 26:14.870
I agreed.

26:18.430 --> 26:19.710
I will give you the salt.

26:29.710 --> 26:30.670
There is one more thing.

26:34.630 --> 26:36.190
Let the mother and daughter meet.

26:41.109 --> 26:42.029
Tingyun.

26:42.470 --> 26:43.430
Mother.

26:43.549 --> 26:44.829
My girl,

26:45.829 --> 26:47.589
I can't imagine
how much you'll have to endure.

26:51.069 --> 26:51.602
No.

26:52.990 --> 26:54.589
You died in Huaying.

26:55.430 --> 26:56.910
Do not let anyone spot you.

27:01.589 --> 27:02.789
I long to know

27:03.029 --> 27:04.549
what path you will take hereafter.

27:08.349 --> 27:10.029
Zhao Ling is a righteous man,

27:10.870 --> 27:12.710
but is he truly a worthy match for you?

27:18.309 --> 27:19.470
Rest assured, Mother.

27:21.190 --> 27:22.710
He merely saved my life,

27:23.589 --> 27:25.150
and I have no intention of marrying him.

27:26.230 --> 27:27.990
This ordeal has opened my eyes.

27:28.950 --> 27:31.269
Once, all I craved
was a prestigious marriage.

27:33.749 --> 27:35.269
But whether it was Grandmother,

27:36.509 --> 27:37.630
or Madam Yu,

27:38.109 --> 27:40.029
they only saw me as a bargaining tool.

27:40.910 --> 27:42.390
That path can never lead to happiness.

27:43.710 --> 27:45.630
Since I was raised
to be a phoenix's perch,

27:46.829 --> 27:47.950
those drawn to me

27:48.430 --> 27:50.109
would surely be noble birds.

27:54.029 --> 27:55.109
Whoever I wed

27:55.749 --> 27:57.029
shall be my perfect match.

27:58.589 --> 28:00.230
All my wish for you

28:01.109 --> 28:03.150
is that you never grow as weak as I am,

28:04.430 --> 28:06.990
nor as cold-hearted as your grandmother.

28:07.870 --> 28:08.710
Mother.

28:10.230 --> 28:11.390
Today, I shall plan

28:13.109 --> 28:15.349
for your future.

28:31.710 --> 28:34.069
I beg you, Mr. Zhao,
to grant me a favor.

28:35.430 --> 28:37.470
My birth family is a wealthy family
in Jiangnan,

28:38.430 --> 28:40.549
and owns several shops in the capital.

28:41.630 --> 28:42.990
Please

28:42.990 --> 28:44.549
escort her to the capital.

28:44.870 --> 28:45.630
Once she arrives,

28:45.630 --> 28:46.950
I will travel to the capital

28:47.029 --> 28:48.390
to reunite with her.

28:50.549 --> 28:52.269
I am willing to reward you

28:52.710 --> 28:53.910
ten thousand taels of silver

28:54.150 --> 28:55.390
for your trouble.

28:57.870 --> 29:00.789
Please accept these silver notes
worth five thousand taels upfront.

29:01.269 --> 29:02.309
I earnestly beg you

29:02.470 --> 29:04.109
to agree to my request.

29:04.269 --> 29:05.589
Once you reach the capital,

29:05.829 --> 29:08.029
you may collect the rest
from her uncle.

29:15.910 --> 29:17.150
I accept your request.

29:19.470 --> 29:20.470
Take this

29:20.950 --> 29:22.269
as our token.

29:24.230 --> 29:25.269
I will surely keep

29:27.710 --> 29:28.710
the promise I made to you.

29:44.116 --> 29:49.463
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

29:50.543 --> 29:56.036
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

29:56.989 --> 30:03.355
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides,
wash away stain of false accusation♪

30:03.438 --> 30:08.811
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

30:09.717 --> 30:15.270
♪Let this humble name
carry me through a life adrift♪

30:15.957 --> 30:21.556
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

30:22.251 --> 30:24.979
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

30:25.022 --> 30:29.328
♪Trade it for boundless blue
skies to fly free and far♪

30:29.721 --> 30:34.722
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

30:36.244 --> 30:43.050
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

31:02.309 --> 31:03.069
Five thousand taels.

31:04.069 --> 31:04.950
Not a single tael missing.

31:08.017 --> 31:09.790
(One thousand taels)

31:14.829 --> 31:16.150
We shall meet again someday.

31:17.549 --> 31:18.390
What should I call you?

31:27.789 --> 31:28.990
Mr. Jin,

31:29.269 --> 31:30.470
may your business thrive

31:30.630 --> 31:31.789
and wealth flow endlessly.

31:35.190 --> 31:36.349
Mr. Zhao,

31:37.789 --> 31:38.990
may you enjoy a long life,

31:40.670 --> 31:41.829
your days endless as the firmament.

32:04.150 --> 32:04.829
Hurry up.

32:05.190 --> 32:06.109
I'll take you to get the salt.

32:08.870 --> 32:09.910
Officer,

32:10.630 --> 32:11.990
spare some salt for us.

32:11.990 --> 32:12.710
Officer.

32:12.990 --> 32:14.470
Have mercy on us, Officer.

32:14.470 --> 32:14.990
Get out of my way.

32:18.470 --> 32:19.069
Are you alright?

32:20.069 --> 32:20.749
I'm fine.

32:24.390 --> 32:24.990
Hey,

32:25.230 --> 32:25.990
are you alright?

32:25.990 --> 32:26.549
I'm fine.

32:28.829 --> 32:30.390
Wealthy folk scatter salt to melt frost.

32:30.390 --> 32:30.990
Have some.

32:31.269 --> 32:32.230
Yet poor souls

32:32.309 --> 32:33.670
must lick salt off walls to survive.

32:34.309 --> 32:35.190
This world

32:35.589 --> 32:36.749
is utterly unjust.

32:54.150 --> 32:55.630
We went through so much trouble

32:55.749 --> 32:57.069
and nearly lost our lives.

32:57.870 --> 32:59.150
Are we really giving all of this
to the common folk?

32:59.990 --> 33:01.269
So long as the hull stays watertight,

33:01.589 --> 33:03.069
we fear no waves crashing the bow.

33:03.670 --> 33:04.910
As long as we hold this token,

33:05.309 --> 33:06.710
we shall never lack fortune.

33:08.029 --> 33:09.269
Huaying

33:09.269 --> 33:10.630
is the Fu family's territory.

33:11.029 --> 33:12.749
The moment we hand out the salt,

33:12.990 --> 33:13.749
the very next instant,

33:13.749 --> 33:16.069
the Fu family will send their man
to seize it

33:16.150 --> 33:17.190
and take every last bit back.

33:19.509 --> 33:20.589
Send word around.

33:21.029 --> 33:23.269
Tell every household
to place their water vats out front.

33:24.190 --> 33:25.430
We'll hand out salt brine instead.

33:26.190 --> 33:27.990
I want every corner of Huaying

33:28.870 --> 33:30.710
stripped clean of Ground Snow entirely.

33:45.549 --> 33:46.349
Salt!

33:46.430 --> 33:48.150
We've got salt, finally!

33:49.190 --> 33:50.390
No more worries now.

33:50.390 --> 33:52.029
We'll have salt to eat.

33:52.990 --> 33:54.430
It'll last us a good long while.

33:54.430 --> 33:55.789
How pure white this salt is!

33:56.069 --> 33:57.990
We're saved. This is wonderful!

33:58.150 --> 33:59.390
Salt dissolves into water,

33:59.589 --> 34:01.269
so greedy lords have nothing to seize.

34:01.630 --> 34:02.789
The brine flows to common folk.

34:03.029 --> 34:03.829
Those in power

34:04.309 --> 34:05.430
can never cut it off.

34:05.950 --> 34:07.109
(Master Zhao)
We've just made inquiries.

34:07.870 --> 34:08.990
Word goes there's a righteous man,

34:09.069 --> 34:10.109
who refuses to leave his name

34:10.390 --> 34:11.549
dissolving salt into brine

34:11.790 --> 34:12.790
to aid the famine-stricken folk.

34:15.430 --> 34:16.830
Interesting.

34:18.229 --> 34:19.390
Dissolve salt into brine.

34:19.549 --> 34:20.270
What bold spirit.

34:20.509 --> 34:21.270
What unrestrained grace.

34:21.990 --> 34:22.910
Someday,

34:23.270 --> 34:24.270
I want to learn this from you.

34:26.790 --> 34:28.029
Learn some good things.

34:28.390 --> 34:29.750
That's Ground Snow we're talking about.

34:30.270 --> 34:31.430
Do you have any idea how valuable it is?

34:35.430 --> 34:36.549
Still, fortune's on my side.

34:40.430 --> 34:41.750
If I escort her back to the capital,

34:41.910 --> 34:43.069
I'll earn five thousand taels in return.

34:45.990 --> 34:46.589
Mr. Zhao,

34:47.790 --> 34:49.229
dry rations and water are all prepared.

34:49.350 --> 34:49.950
Besides,

34:49.950 --> 34:51.310
I've brought cotton cloth
and medicinal herbs for you.

34:51.589 --> 34:53.270
Refugees crowd every corner
of the Western Capital region right now.

34:53.270 --> 34:53.990
On this journey,

34:53.990 --> 34:55.069
you'll surely brave the elements.

34:55.149 --> 34:56.790
If any other troubles arise,

34:56.870 --> 34:57.750
you must act

34:57.750 --> 34:58.750
as circumstances demand.

34:58.750 --> 34:59.109
Don't worry.

35:01.669 --> 35:02.990
How long

35:03.910 --> 35:04.669
will it take

35:04.669 --> 35:05.709
to reach the capital?

35:05.990 --> 35:07.470
Will we travel by land the whole way?

35:07.470 --> 35:08.549
Or will we take river routes as well?

35:08.830 --> 35:09.549
Just follow us.

35:10.229 --> 35:11.310
Quit chattering so much.

35:15.990 --> 35:16.430
Let's go.

35:25.057 --> 35:29.690
(Huaying)

35:32.770 --> 35:34.503
(Betrothal Letter)

35:50.853 --> 35:54.743
(Fu Family Academy)

35:58.109 --> 35:58.950
Yake,

36:00.910 --> 36:02.509
is this truly what you desire?

36:03.430 --> 36:04.750
Marriage is a lifelong matter,

36:06.589 --> 36:07.830
bound by parents' will,

36:09.270 --> 36:10.509
and arranged by matchmakers' words.

36:10.710 --> 36:12.227
(Betrothal Letter)

36:12.270 --> 36:14.270
Since Madam Yu herself
proposed this marriage,

36:14.790 --> 36:16.189
and you have given your consent,

36:18.310 --> 36:21.029
I'll sincerely uphold this marriage,

36:21.750 --> 36:23.270
and never bring shame upon you, Father.

36:25.509 --> 36:26.270
Yake,

36:27.870 --> 36:28.990
you may fool everyone else,

36:28.990 --> 36:30.390
but you cannot fool me.

36:30.990 --> 36:32.629
(Betrothal Letter)
You knew they are at odds.

36:32.629 --> 36:34.830
why involve yourself in this marriage?

36:35.189 --> 36:36.470
The Yu family holds great power,

36:36.750 --> 36:38.589
yet a powerful family
makes an ill-suited match.

36:38.709 --> 36:41.229
You are the one
who will live out every day to come.

36:41.990 --> 36:43.830
Since I brought this marriage to pass,

36:44.029 --> 36:45.589
I shall tend to it faithfully.

36:46.430 --> 36:48.870
Father, do not underestimate me
like everyone else.

37:05.029 --> 37:05.870
All right.

37:08.870 --> 37:09.589
Yet,

37:10.350 --> 37:11.470
(Fu Family Academy)
I can no longer bear

37:12.270 --> 37:14.229
to stay here.

37:14.870 --> 37:15.709
I own

37:16.549 --> 37:18.629
a residence in Yongning Prefecture.

37:19.390 --> 37:20.589
It is plain and humble,

37:21.549 --> 37:23.029
but sufficient to prepare your dowry.

37:24.790 --> 37:26.109
Your mother passed away long ago,

37:26.549 --> 37:28.470
leaving us to rely on each other.

37:29.149 --> 37:30.189
I know

37:31.709 --> 37:33.310
you have endured many grievances.

37:33.910 --> 37:35.830
I am not fit to teach you any lessons.

37:36.950 --> 37:37.950
But Yake,

37:40.669 --> 37:41.990
you must bear this in mind.

37:43.629 --> 37:45.029
No matter what the future holds,

37:45.709 --> 37:47.310
do not regret the choice you make today.

37:51.709 --> 37:52.870
Fate is decreed by heaven.

37:53.589 --> 37:54.589
Since this is my destined lot,

37:56.109 --> 37:57.629
I shall follow its course willingly.

37:58.470 --> 37:59.189
Father,

38:00.069 --> 38:01.069
all these years,

38:01.870 --> 38:03.350
you've run our household
with frugality and diligence.

38:04.189 --> 38:06.029
I've never told you this,

38:06.709 --> 38:08.750
but I loathe leftover cold rice.

38:10.069 --> 38:11.790
Living on leftovers day after day,

38:12.669 --> 38:15.069
a musty, shabby scent
clings to the skin.

38:18.310 --> 38:19.910
That odor never fails to remind me

38:22.709 --> 38:24.509
that I am beneath others.

38:29.143 --> 38:31.703
(Next Episode)

38:31.870 --> 38:32.870
Thanks to you,

38:33.029 --> 38:34.509
we're being chased
by all sorts of people.

38:35.310 --> 38:36.629
I promised your mother,

38:36.870 --> 38:37.990
I'd take you back to the capital.

38:38.390 --> 38:39.310
If I head to the capital

38:39.310 --> 38:41.270
without clearing things up,

38:41.629 --> 38:43.549
won't I be admitting to adultery?

38:49.990 --> 38:51.709
I beg you! Spare his life!

38:53.029 --> 38:54.430
Let him go!

38:54.870 --> 38:56.629
I'm begging you!

38:58.549 --> 39:00.029
Don't kill him!

39:14.520 --> 39:18.840
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

39:22.440 --> 39:26.800
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

39:28.920 --> 39:33.560
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

39:33.800 --> 39:36.600
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

39:37.760 --> 39:42.400
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

39:45.600 --> 39:52.440
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

39:53.320 --> 39:59.840
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

40:00.800 --> 40:04.240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

40:04.760 --> 40:08.960
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

40:09.240 --> 40:14.920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

40:27.040 --> 40:30.920
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

40:34.840 --> 40:38.840
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

40:40.560 --> 40:45.240
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

40:45.560 --> 40:48.240
♪Kept close within my heart♪

40:49.320 --> 40:54.160
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

40:57.680 --> 41:04.600
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

41:05.480 --> 41:11.960
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

41:12.840 --> 41:16.360
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:16.800 --> 41:21.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:21.360 --> 41:27.080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
